X:1
T:La Foule
C:Angel Cabral and Michel Rivgauche, 1957 (Edith Piaf)
N:Best-effort version. Melody is the pan flute line of an arrangement MIDI
N:(hamienet.com), a live-style performance with many grace notes; those were
N:dropped and the rest rounded to eighths, so some rhythms are approximate.
N:Chords come from the arrangement's guitar. One pass is three 8-bar strains
N:(A B A); the last bar carries the pickup into the next pass.
